      "side": 1,
      "message": "Stale local submodule URL, not the change.\n\nYour modules/jgit is still cached against gerrit.googlesource.com/jgit (replication broken); this change repoints it to eclipse.gerrithub.io/eclipse-jgit/jgit, but git fetch recurses into the submodule and hits the old URL before the new one is applied.\n\nCI doesn\u0027t see this — it clones fresh each run.\n\nVerified fix (`git submodule` sync is the key step):\n\n```bash\n git -c fetch.recurseSubmodules\u003dno fetch https://gerrit.googlesource.com/gerrit refs/changes/81/597681/9\n git -c submodule.recurse\u003d0 checkout FETCH_HEAD\n git submodule sync\n git submodule update --init modules/jgit\n```",
